BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/avif:https://iondistrict.com/wp
 -content/uploads/2025/02/Wade-Houston-Startup-Speedrun.avif?ver=1741041257
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/avif:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/0
 2/Wade-Houston-Startup-Speedrun.avif?ver=1741041257
UID:nXwqQMUCqv5A4zUFPDLpm
SUMMARY:Houston Startup Speedrun
DTSTAMP:20260818T032841Z
DTSTART:20260820T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/wades-houston-start
	up-speedrun-at-the-ion-tickets-1988360089553?aff=erelexpmlt \nThe Houston 
	Startup Speedrun is an intensive and fast-paced program designed to provid
	e both early-stage founders and aspiring entrepreneurs with a comprehensiv
	e understanding of the Startup Founder’s Journey and the Houston startup e
	cosystem through a carefully curated curriculum consisting of 10 consecuti
	ve 50-minute sessions. Wade Pinder\, your host and facilitator\, is an exp
	erienced and trusted ecosystem guide for many Houston-based stakeholders. 
	With a focus on efficiency and accommodating the schedules of full-time wo
	rking professionals\, this program aims to quickly give you a “lay of the 
	land” while preparing you for your entrepreneurial journey.\n\nhttps://ion
	district.com/event/houston-startup-speedrun-7/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/houston-startup-speedrun-7/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT10H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.o
 rg/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Docent-Volunteer.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://houstonarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2
 024/04/Docent-Volunteer.jpg
UID:i722f4iDc-ggowr73WneV
SUMMARY:Docent Recruitment Open House & Breakfast
DTSTAMP:20260818T032841Z
DTSTART:20260820T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:FreeRegistration encouraged\; walk-in participants welcomeAges 
	21+ \n\n\n\nCalling all nature lovers! We are looking to grow our team of 
	Arboretum Docents and would like to invite you to learn more at this infor
	mational breakfast. Docents are volunteers who are specially trained to en
	gage visitors of all ages and backgrounds in active explorations of our tr
	ails and Discovery Room. We are currently recruiting individuals for our u
	pcoming docent trainings to prepare for fall programs! \n\n\n\n\nRSVP Onli
	ne\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nConcerned that you know very little about natural hist
	ory\, native flora/fauna\, or the Arboretum in general? Not to worry! Doce
	nt training is comprehensive and includes extensive content-based classes 
	as well as training on effective touring techniques. \n\n\n\nIf you are in
	terested in helping us teach our visitors about nature and all it has to o
	ffer\, we encourage you to attend!\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/d
	ocent-recruitment-open-house-breakfast/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature
	 Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/docent-recruitment-open-house-breakf
	ast/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-arboretum
CATEGORIES:Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
