SUMMARY:Bat Fest
DTSTAMP:20260818T032843Z
DTSTART:20260926T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Free\, no registration requiredAll ages welcome \n\n\n\nJoin us
	 for our 5th annual Bat Fest! From pollinating to pest control\, bats play
	 an important role in keeping our ecosystems healthy. Learn about local ba
	t species and current conservation efforts to help stop the decline of bat
	 populations. There will be fun bat-themed activities and crafts for the k
	ids\, story time\, food trucks\, and a blood drive with Gulf Coast Regiona
	l Blood Center. This family-friendly event is free and open to the public.
	 \n\n\n\nWant more bat-themed fun in your life? Join us Saturday\, Septemb
	er 12 for Going Batty\, a fun event complete with a bat expert and adult b
	everages. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPresented By\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/eve
	nt/bat-fest/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/bat-fest/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-arboretum
CATEGORIES:Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
